# vercel deploy uploads the working directory, and agent worktrees live inside
# the primary checkout at .worktrees/<agent> with their own 700MB+ node_modules.
# One stuck seven-minute deploy from the primary checkout taught us that the
# gitignore alone is not a deploy guard: it only protects a checkout that has
# pulled the commit carrying the entry. This file is checked at upload time by
# every tree that has it.
.worktrees
